        y: 5,
      },
      {
        tag: "unit",
        id: "u_9",
        type: "Young Ogre",
        side: 3,
        x: 19,
        y: 6,
      },
      {
        tag: "unit",
        id: "u_10",
        type: "Ogre",
        side: 3,
        x: 22,
        y: 2,
      },
      {
        tag: "unit",
        id: "Ro_Sothian",
        type: "Lich",
        side: 0,
        x: 25,
        y: 6,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_33",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_bonus",
            value: "yes",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_34",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Tallin and his men made an orderly withdrawal into the caves, the orcs pressing close behind them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_35",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("The dwarves were more than ready for them, however, and as soon as the humans got through the defenses the well-prepared dwarves fell on the battle-weary and bloodied orcs."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_36",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Wave after wave of orcs crashed onto the dwarven defenses only to be shattered."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_37",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("As the battle raged on, Tallin again made council with Hamel."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_38",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ How did ye fare?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_39",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ It was fierce and bloody. We fought them for three days and nights. Every time we killed an orc, it seemed that two more would take his place. We most assuredly cannot win fighting like this."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_40",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ So you withdrew. Rightly done, me lad. Our prepared defenses will be able to hold the orcs off far longer and with less loss than ye could ha’ done in the open field. I see that my training of you hasna’ been for naught."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_41",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ And I am grateful — but what should we do from here? The number of humans and dwarves is limited, unlike the orcs whose numbers seem unlimited."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_42",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Aye. But we must utterly crush this orcish host if we are to ever ha’ peace."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_43",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Orcs are fickle; if we negotiated a treaty with them — assuming they would accept — it would just be broken as soon as the next warlord arose among them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_44",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Then what shall we do? Can we assassinate this Rakshas fellow and throw them into disarray once more?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_45",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ That will be very difficult. We did that last time and they will no doubt be alert to that threat now. Anyway, it would be but a temporary solution. Soon another strong leader would come along, and we’d find oursel’ back in the same coil."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_46",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Well, back to the drawing board. What should we do?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_47",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I think we should try to gather more allies. That way we can engage them on many fronts, or divide them into smaller groups, or cut them off from their supplies. The possibilities are endless."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_48",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Wise words, but who is there in these wild Northlands that might aid us?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_49",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ You can count the elves out. They are a selfish lot, only interested in themselves. They would only aid us if something drastic happened to them and they needed our help. What about Wesnoth?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_50",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Wesnoth is too far away, and we have no idea what political state they are in."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_51",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ The last news we heard of them was years ago when Prince Konrad passed through here. At that time the evil Queen Asheviere was ruling, and it was said that she was in alliance with the orcs."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_52",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ And then that Princess Li’sar was in hot pursuit of Konrad as well. I wonder what became of them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_53",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ The last time any dwarf set eyes on Konrad was when he set out to the eastern tunnels in search of the Sceptre of Fire, so he could claim his place as ruler."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_54",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Geez, what a fool’s quest. Everyone in these Northlands knows that the Sceptre is long gone."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_55",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ But we’re meandering. Where can we find allies in these wild Northlands?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_56",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Father_Morvin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Tallin, before I was captured by Malifor, I used to be in contact with a powerful magician called Ro’Arthian and his brother Ro’Sothian."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_57",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Ro’Arthian, bah! Don’t utter that cursed name!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_58",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Why not, Hamel, have you a grievance with him?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_59",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I have heard all about him from my good friend Stalrag. He is — or was anyway, haven’t heard from him in years — the chief o’ the villages that lay along Highbrook Pass."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_60",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Those foul mages have long terrorized Stalrag and his people."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_61",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Father_Morvin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Remember, Hamel, there are often two sides to a story like this. Perhaps the mages see your dwarves as invaders. How would you feel if say... the elves decided to come in and level Knalga so they can grow another big forest on top?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_62",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Those filthy elves! I’ll..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_63",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Father_Morvin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ See?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_64",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ What were you doing keeping contact with mages such as those anyway? Trying to save their souls?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_65",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Sister_Thera.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ (<i>Giggle</i>) Something like that."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_66",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Father_Morvin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ (<i>Rolls eyes</i>)"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_67",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Father Morvin, what are you trying to say?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_68",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Father_Morvin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I propose that we go to Highbrook Pass and see how matters stand for ourselves. If the wizards are still alive, we might be able to persuade them to help us. What’s more, if Stalrag is still around we could use his help too."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_69",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I don’t see how just two mages could help us very much, Father."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_70",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Father_Morvin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ They are not just any two mages. They have fine control over many creatures of the wild such as ogres, gryphons, and sometimes even trolls! It would be no bad thing to have those on your side for once."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_71",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ That sounds really good. What do you think, Hamel?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_72",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Hrmph. These are desperate times. If those lunatics of mages will agree to help, I guess we’ll nae have any other choice but to accept."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_73",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Hey, we have had experiences with crazy mages ourselves. Believe me, they are dangerous! You will feel a lot better with some of them on your side."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_74",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Hamel.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Ye’ll need to travel light to reach Highbrook Pass before the orcs mount another assault in force. I think ye should take as little gold as possible. We’ll store the rest in the tunnels furthest away from the attacking orcs in case they break through."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_75",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/Tallin.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ So it shall be. Now how exactly do we get to this mountain pass?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_76",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("And so Tallin and his party set out to secure the help of the mages."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_77",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Tallin,Stalrag,Ro_Arthian",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "clock_78",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "turn_limit",
            value: 20,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _("Save Stalrag from Ro’Sothian Capture Ro’Arthian"),
        defeat: _("Death of Tallin Death of Stalrag Turns run out"),
        children: [
          {
            tag: "defeat",
            condition: "hook",
            hook: "predicate:turn_limit",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "side_traits_1",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            id: "Stalrag",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22side_traits_2%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%7B%22applyTo%22%3A%22hitpoints%22%2C%22increaseTotal%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22applyTo%22%3A%22hitpoints%22%2C%22increaseTotal%22%3A1%7D%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_2",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "frantic.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "knalgan_theme.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "siege_of_laurelmor.ogg",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 1,
            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 2,
            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
