      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Upon arriving at the mountain pass it appeared to Tallin and his men that they were just a bit too late."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("HAH! I finally have you, you wretched dwarf!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Stalrag",
            text: _("Argh! You blasted mages! How many times do I have to kill you two before you will leave us in peace!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Leave <i>you</i> in peace?! It is your kind that won’t leave <i>us</i> in peace! Ever since you blasted dwarves built that damn road you have harassed us unceasingly! Now, it ends here! After I kill you I will split your carcass and hang it at the mouth of this pass as a warning for any other fools like you! And unlike us, <i>you</i> won’t come back."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Stalrag",
            text: _("You cursed mage! I now go to join all of my men you have killed. But know this, the Shinsplitters will <i>never</i> submit! We will defy you to our last breath!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Hold it! What’s going on here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Ro’Sothian, is that you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Not now, Father. I’m a little busy at the moment."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Hang on a sec, Ro’Sothian, you don’t want to kill him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Huh?! He killed me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Oh... I see. But we come on more pressing business. We are in desperate need of your help. Here is Tallin from the community of Dwarven Doors. As you know, the people of Dwarven Doors were enslaved by the orcs for many years. They have broken their chains and together with Lord Hamel from Knalga, they are beginning to reclaim Knalga from the chaos that it was in."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("So? What does this have to do with me? And hurry up, my staff is buzzing to blast this little vermin once and for all."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Don’t! Please, my friend, listen. The orcs are on the rise again and they are threatening to complete their conquest of Knalga and convert it into an orcish stronghold. We can’t let that happen! That’s why we have come here, to seek your and your brother’s help in defeating the orcs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Take your begging and shove it, Father! We don’t help no-one. Not even you and <i>especially</i> not any dwarf!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("I tire of this; prepare to die, wretched dwarf! And the rest of you, get lost and don’t come back, unless you’re tired of life!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sister Thera",
            text: _("Uh oh, he is gathering energy for a cold blast."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Quick, honey, we’ve got to stop him!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Sister Thera",
            x: 25,
            y: 6,
            to_x: 24,
            to_y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Father Morvin",
            x: 27,
            y: 6,
            to_x: 26,
            to_y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1250,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ro'Sothian%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Ahhhh! Not again!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Come on, Ro’Sothian, we really don’t have to be doing this. Come, join us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Never!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Sigh, we’ll talk later."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Back to jail, my friend."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 3,
            x: 24,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "unit_exists",
                exists: "no",
                id: "Ro'Sothian",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 25,
            y: 6,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "rosothian",
            x: 25,
            y: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            moves: "full",
            amount: "full",
            restore_attacks: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ro'Sothian%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Ro'Sothian",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("Ha! I am free! Now you foul traitors will pay!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Oh no, he got away! Quick, men, we must capture him again!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ro'Sothian%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("BROTHER! HELP ME!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("(<i>Booming voice coming from all directions</i>) SO YOU MAGES HAVE THE AUDACITY TO ATTACK MY BROTHER! YOU SHALL DIE FOR YOUR FOLLY!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Ro’Arthian, listen to me. We don’t want to fight with you, we have come here to seek your assistance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "none",
            text: _("(<i>No answer</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("I know you can hear me, Ro’Arthian. Please, the fate of every creature in the north depends on your help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "none",
            text: _("(<i>No answer</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Give it up, father, he isn’t answering. I am afraid we may have to use um... more forceful means to convince him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("(<i>Sigh</i>) Yes, you are right."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Put Ro’Sothian into that jail over there until we capture his brother."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Very well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("And someone keep an eye on him. We don’t want him to get away."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "defeat_arthian",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "die",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ro'Sothian%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "rosothian",
            kill: "no",
            id: "Ro'Sothian",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 25,
            y: 6,
            item_name: "",
            image: "units%2Fundead-necromancers%2Flich.png~RC(magenta%3Egreen)~BLIT(items%2Fcage.png)",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_20",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ro'Arthian%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            amount: 1,
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ro'Arthian%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Ro'Arthian",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Ro’Arthian, are you ready to talk yet?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("Fine, you trespassers. What do you want?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Well... First, why don’t you tell us what <i>you</i> want?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("What do <i>I</i> want? I’ll tell you what I want! I want the stinking carcasses of you, all your henchmen and those dwarvish vermin off my land! And <i>stay</i> off!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("So basically, you want to be left alone in peace, right?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("Wow! Someone <i>finally</i> figured it out!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("All right! Listen, then. Right now we have very little power to grant your request. We are simply a band of peasants fighting for the freedom of our homeland."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("But when we defeat the orcish host, re-establish Knalga, and bring law and order into these Northlands, we will have gained some authority by right of conquest."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("When that time comes, I hereby make a solemn oath: no man or dwarf shall ever set foot on your land without your leave. If any of my men violates this law they shall be punished with death, and I believe I may speak for Hamel in this as well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("In order for that to come about, we must crush the orcish host. But we can’t do that without your help. Will you join us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Father Morvin",
            text: _("Think of it, Ro’Arthian, it is a fair bargain. If you don’t agree to Tallin’s proposal, the endless war you two wage with the dwarves will never be resolved. You have been haunting these mountains for far too long. It is high time for you and your brother to rest in peace."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("Hrmph. What do you think, brother?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Sothian",
            text: _("(<i>Shrugs</i>) I don’t think we have any other choice left."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Come on, guys, it will be great! Those orcs will never know what hit them! Together we’ll rip them to shreds! If you are planning to retire after this, this is the perfect chance for you guys to go out with a bang! You guys will become legends! <i>“The two terrible mages, risen from the dead to devastate the orcish hordes!”</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("Very well, Tallin. We accept under the terms that your people will forever leave us in peace after this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Ro’Arthian, I am not of royal blood, but I am a man of my word. I will uphold the oath I have given even at the cost of my life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("Very well. The orcish hosts shall feel our wrath!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Stalrag",
            text: _("Wait a second, Tallin. Are you saying that we should abandon our homeland to these wretched mages?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("(<i>Snicker</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Chief Stalrag, it is said that to save a family, we should be willing to sacrifice one person; to save a town we should be willing to sacrifice a family; and to save a nation we should be willing to sacrifice a town."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Now, Stalrag, it is up to you. Do you want to save Knalga or not?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Stalrag",
            text: _("Well Tallin, if you put it that way... We don’t like it, but if that’s what is needed to save Knalga, we shall do it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Thank you, Stalrag. I am sure that the sacrifice of you and your people will always be remembered."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Stalrag",
            text: _("(<i>Mumbles</i>) Yeah, great compensation..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("I have the power to control many creatures, such as gryphons, trolls and ogres. So while I am with you they shall be at your command."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Stalrag",
            text: _("The Shinsplitters will be at your service, Tallin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("My thanks, Stalrag and Ro’Arthian. However, I have sufficient forces under my control presently and I think that merging our forces will just create confusion. Your gryphons will be of use, but I think you should retain command of your trolls and ogres, until they are needed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ro'Arthian",
            text: _("Very well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Great. Now let’s get back to the caves and start planning the best way teach those orcs a lesson they will never forget!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
